# OpenSoMRuntime .gitignore

# Ignore everything by default
/*

# Keep these directories
!/Assets
!/Packages
!/ProjectSettings

# We want to ignore streaming assets, as it is absolutely filled with SoM game data. We will keep the data for Reign (as I have the rights to do so), and the soundfonts.
/Assets/StreamingAssets/*
!/Assets/StreamingAssets/GameData_Reign
!/Assets/StreamingAssets/GameData_Reign.meta
!/Assets/StreamingAssets/SoundFont

# Apparently git also needs these explicity ignored...
!/.gitattributes
!/.gitignore

*.csproj
*.sln